id=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a6YpyN9lC8EQ7kNvwEfMRFL&_nc_oc=AdqTYCFSuk0OzsX4MgXP2PvPqO7WcyLvzXdJu3Kz9AEavZEknESYlOnoHS9El7tl0fs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9gycY2KFypxN_FLNL1vm_EYp2s-69aP2xDce9x8e8Ag&oe=6AA41B54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "1688180008799352", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391794_1688180012132685_6578342351747779273_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LseKoQm1i-kQ7kNvwHS4crF&_nc_oc=Ado4UHfYwbSKuISUDpU3CwXzDTRIxYgx6QElZ_QbhLbqz5yWXdZCN9Vpoxh9kZueFs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ0oem_5gic9e9_QfhjSZ1wxpl9al3QE6fDppq0xVKtZw&oe=6AA4063D"}, "display_name": "Helping Hand", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Helping Hand\n\nAn immersive VR experience that will challenge you with puzzles, tension and a creature to protect.\n\n\n# A Thrilling Adventure That Will Keep You on Edge\n\nIn Helping Hand, you find yourself trapped in a house haunted by dark entities. But you are not alone. A mysterious newborn creature desperately needs your help to survive. Your mission? Work together, solve puzzles and find a way to escape before the shadows lurking in the house catch you.\n\n\n# Solve Puzzles and Interact with the Environment\n\nExplore eerie rooms, manipulate objects, and use the environment to your advantage to overcome obstacles and dangers. Each puzzle is designed to take full advantage of virtual reality, offering a highly immersive and realistic experience.\n\n\n# Protect a Unique Companion\n\nThe small creature by your side is more than just a traveling companion\u2014it\u2019s a key part of the gameplay. Communicate with it, understand its needs and combine your abilities to survive. But be careful\u2026 if it falls into the wrong hands, it\u2019s game over.\n\n\n# Escape the Shadows That Hunt You\n\nYou are not alone in this house. Something evil lurks in the darkness, watching you. You\u2019ll need to move carefully, stay silent and find ways to outsmart the creatures that are after you.", "short_description": "Helping Hand is a VR Puzzle Platform Game where the player has to save a newborn creature from a house haunted by dark presences. Collaborate with the creature, solve the puzzles and escape from the monsters which are hunting it in an adventure that will leave you breathless."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_Landscape.png", "id": "1698270810774305", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392282_1698270814107638_5900804102187082029_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=chkNnU418_UQ7kNvwFjtWPf&_nc_oc=AdrbgMRV3BKca9taMm2NWf9LRq76h1nl9aA29G0QBoX91U27N9F6igMn3MfeZjoYWiA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJoe3yZr9SHD27sRc9XCb5tG9jczuC5zO-n2iPHpbLawA&oe=6AA4104B"}, {"file_name": "cover_Minilandscape.png", "id": "1350767782930760", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391815_1350767792930759_4872266246620158648_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-McSAzXQSuoQ7kNvwHGPJOP&_nc_oc=AdpXlzt7lEKaEPxhsFKXKB-UY-x83pVOAfdvvQsmDY6-zGyeBOBEURW4HGEo1FAJuoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLqe_ETGaiTAiv2G_wDKqePgwsVPuSMDjxclrpA6t1TWA&oe=6AA3F71E"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1312403866514020", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391859_1312403869847353_7293217735353373313_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KumOkmQtr2kQ7kNvwEQHBpw&_nc_oc=AdpOEgzHpCZDYcTYI0ncdhfNy2BOKIzSqzjkISJ4L-P3kMD5fvxW496f3ltb_myF0O4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKKpWqmuWUhFLknaoc9ru3-f8whchyhBLkEvjGEUmuexw&oe=6AA400A2"}, {"file_name": "hero_Cover.png", "id": "1166087378314033", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco